  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "SciGenBench",
  "description": "\nScientific Image Synthesis: Benchmarking, Methodologies, and Downstream Utility\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\nSciGenBench benchmarks scientific image generation with a hybrid protocol: Inverse Quiz Validation (Rinv) + LMM-as-Judge.ImgCoder enables logic-driven, verifiable diagrams via Understand \u2192 Plan \u2192 Code.High-fidelity synthetic images \u2192 stronger multimodal reasoning.\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nScientific images require logical correctness beyond visual plausibility. We systematically study scientific\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/J017athan/SciGenBench.",
  "alternateName": [
    "J017athan/SciGenBench"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Chonghan, Qin",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/J017athan"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "text-to-image",
    "English",
    "apache-2.0",
    "10K - 100K",
    "parquet",
    "Image",
    "Text",
